This package does not bundle or redistribute FreeCAD. It drives a FreeCAD
installation that is already present on the machine, by spawning its headless
command line (`freecadcmd`) and by importing FreeCAD's own Python modules inside
that process's environment.

Third-party components that are used at run time but NOT distributed here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
FreeCAD
    https://www.freecad.org/
    License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
    Used as an external program; the plugin ships no FreeCAD source or binaries.

Python packages shipped inside the FreeCAD Python environment
    Pillow / PIL  — HPND license   (crop, resize and export of rendered images)
    matplotlib    — PSF-based matplotlib license   (SVG / PDF / PNG output)
    These are provided by the user's FreeCAD installation, not by this package.

DeepSeek Harness
    https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-Harness
    The plugin declares `@deepseek-ai/*` packages as peer dependencies of the
    host (`ctx.tools`, `ctx.slots`, `ctx.configForms`); no harness code is
    vendored into this repository.

Testing models
--------------

`examples/demo_bracket.step` and `examples/demo_bracket.FCStd` are synthetic
parts created for this project. No customer or third-party CAD data is included.
